sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Backend tin cậy
    participant A as FastAPI / chat()
    participant R as AgentHarnessRuntime
    participant C as MCP catalog
    participant G as Outer graph
    participant M as MCP memory
    participant L as Deep hoặc ReAct + LLM
    participant T as Business tools / MCP
    participant K as MCP knowledge
    participant E as BGE-M3 encoder
    participant Q as Qdrant hybrid index
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant W as LangMem worker
    B->>A: POST /v1/chat/turns + internal token
    A->>A: Validate request, đảm bảo session ID
    A->>R: run(turn)
    opt Chưa có release context
        R->>K: eval.knowledge_release
        K->>D: Validate release / snapshot
        D-->>K: Release ref
        K-->>R: Release ID + manifest hash
        R->>R: Ghim release cho lượt
    end
    Note over R: Lock session, kiểm identity fingerprint
    alt Response cache hit
        R-->>A: Response đã cache
    else Lượt chưa cache
        opt Cần resolve / nâng cấp identity
            R->>C: crm.get_customer
            C-->>R: known / unknown / ambiguous
        end
        R->>G: ainvoke(state, thread_id)
        G->>G: accept: mask PII, khởi tạo lượt
        G->>M: retrieve_context: memory.read
        M->>D: History + facts + episodes / completed revisions
        D-->>M: Context
        M-->>G: Context
        opt Cần freshness / brief
            G->>C: inventory.check + pricing.get_quote
            C-->>G: Tool evidence hiện tại
        end
        alt Memory lỗi / yêu cầu handoff / erasure
            G->>G: Nhánh sớm: safe draft hoặc handoff
            opt Handoff đủ điều kiện
                G->>T: handoff.transfer
                T-->>G: Kết quả ticket
            end
        else Luồng agent thông thường
            G->>L: Prompt + role history + facts
            loop Trong business tool budget / recursion limit
                L->>T: Tool đề xuất qua middleware + policy
                alt policy.search
                    T->>T: Ngày đơn từ order.status, ký trusted context
                    T->>K: policy.search + signed request context
                    K->>K: Validate principal, signature, ready, deadline
                    K->>D: Resolve pinned hybrid release
                    D-->>K: Manifest
                    K->>E: Encode query trong queue hữu hạn
                    E-->>K: Dense + sparse vectors
                    K->>Q: Hai prefetch + RRF, filter release/public/model
                    Q-->>K: Candidate IDs + hashes
                    K->>D: Read snapshot, hashes, revocation
                    D-->>K: Source content + metadata
                    K->>K: Date/applicability rules + required links
                    K->>D: Recheck snapshot / revocation
                    D-->>K: Nguồn còn hợp lệ
                    K-->>T: Evidence content + applicability + evidence_set
                else Công cụ catalog / order
                    T->>D: Business rules + transaction
                    D-->>T: Kết quả
                end
                T-->>L: Observation đã lọc / che
            end
            L-->>G: Agent draft
        end
        G->>G: verify: grounding/applicability + optional answer checks
        opt Draft bị reject
            G->>G: Safe recovery hoặc fallback
        end
        alt Erasure memory barrier
            G->>G: Bỏ persist theo memory_blocked
        else Persist lượt
            G->>M: memory.write(commit_turn, operation_key)
            M->>D: Transaction: turn + links + job nếu identified
            D-->>M: Commit OK; có thể kèm gap event khi bật loop
            M-->>G: turn_no, memory_writes=[]
            Note over G,M: Commit lỗi làm request thất bại; không trả success
        end
        G-->>R: Final graph state
        R->>R: Cache response + state trong process
        R-->>A: Text / brief / handoff / IDs
    end
    A-->>B: ChatResponse
    opt Có job distillation
        W->>D: Lease job, đọc committed evidence
        W->>W: LangMem extraction + evidence admission
        W->>D: Ghi accepted revisions + hoàn thành job
        Note over W,D: Ngoài đường đồng bộ trả lời; eval đợi riêng sau runtime.run
    end
